{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19842","headline":"感怀 二 · 孟郊","name":"感怀 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"晨登洛阳坂，目极天茫茫。\n羣物归大化，六龙颓西荒。\n豺狼日已多，草木日已霜。\n饥年无遗粟，衆鸟去空场。\n路傍谁家子，白首离故乡。\n含酸望松栢，仰面诉穹苍。\n去去勿复道，苦饥形貌伤。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19842.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19842","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}